505" owner_email="dhendrix@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="2" project="chromiumos/platform/ec" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec" ref="refs/changes/05/365505/2" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="Ic88063dbc535cf84f3bc0c37f8510669f1ca6c3d" commit="78cb96265ab299cffae06ac6a56d34db9dc79629" commit_message="chipset-apl: Disable ACPI AC device to use USB PD driver  To have power manager work better with USB PD charging disable the AC power supply driver in the kernel so it will only use the USB PD power supply driver.  Signed-off-by: Benson Leung &lt;bleung@chromium.org&gt;  BUG=chrome-os-partner:55880 TEST=emerge-reef chromeos-kernel-4_4 ls /sys/class/power_supply Check that AC doesn't appear  Change-Id: Ic88063dbc535cf84f3bc0c37f8510669f1ca6c3d Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/365891 Commit-Ready: Benson Leung &lt;bleung@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Benson Leung &lt;bleung@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Duncan Laurie &lt;dlaurie@google.com&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="365891" owner_email="bleung@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="1" project="chromiumos/overlays/board-overlays" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/overlays/board-overlays" ref="refs/changes/91/365891/1" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="I1b60d8ce59d36b4b7242beaf6fd39c36340a6bed" commit="c3023ef93bd4ef98befc27c0e8c8b372d2a6b8fd" commit_message="libcontainer_overrides: Remove debugging statements  This removes the fprintf and perror calls used for debugging broker_client  BUG=chromium:622796 TEST=none  Change-Id: I1b60d8ce59d36b4b7242beaf6fd39c36340a6bed Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/363930 Commit-Ready: Keshav Santhanam &lt;ksanthanam@google.com&gt; Tested-by: Keshav Santhanam &lt;ksanthanam@google.com&gt; Reviewed-by: Dylan Reid &lt;dgreid@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="2" gerrit